title: HDFS-16385. Fix Datanode retrieve slownode information bug.
category: bugfix
requirement: '## Context

  Consumers of the DataNode heartbeat response need to know when the NameNode has marked a DataNode as slow, but that signal currently does not flow through the server-side response translation.

  ## Desired outcome

  The heartbeat response should propagate the slow-node indicator all the way to callers instead of dropping it during protobuf construction.

  ## Acceptance signals

  Clients can read the `isSlownode` state from the heartbeat response and see the same slow-node decision that the NameNode made.

  '

